{"n": 856, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "856.webp", "text": "3051119)\n\n41-505\n\n4152004 ADJUSTING LEFT OR RIGHT\nREAR DOOR\n\nAdjusting Rear Door On Hinges:\nRemove door trim panel, we 51742 001\n\nPull off plastic sheet partially,\nInstallation:\nReplace damaged plastic sheet.\n\nLoosen bolts at top.\n\nNote:\n\nEngine hood trunk lid and doors are fitted\nand bolted in an unfinished body shell.\nUnpainted surfaces will be visible after making\nadjustments.\n\nPaint these surfaces with pertinent body color\nPaint.\n\nLoosen bolts at bottom.\n\n30 41406\n\nits) a\n*\n70 41 420\n\nAdjust door outer panel surface to same plane\n‘af front door with shims.\n\nNote:\n\nBasic adjustment should be made with Timm\n(0.039\"\") thick shins (1),\n\nFine adjustment is made with shims (2) in\nthicknesses of optionally 0.5 mm (0.020\")\nand 1.0 mm (0.039).\n\nNote:\n\nThe rear door outer panel surface may be\nadjusted “deeper” than the front door by up\nto max. 1 mm (0.039\"), in order to prevent\nwind noise and stone damage as well as for\ncompensation of optical irregularities\n(tolerances in the curvature).\n\nAdjust door to have uniform gaps at front\nand rear.\n\nAdjustdoor at top with embossed edges\nNote:\n\nLoosen striker on door lock, if necresary", "words": [["3051119)", 0.2022, 0.2659, 0.2503, 0.2778], ["41-505", 0.4712, 0.0205, 0.547, 0.043], ["4152004", 0.2634, 0.0628, 0.3119, 0.0734], ["ADJUSTING", 0.3261, 0.0628, 0.3888, 0.0747], ["LEFT", 0.3928, 0.0628, 0.4196, 0.0734], ["OR", 0.4247, 0.0628, 0.4398, 0.0734], ["RIGHT", 0.4449, 0.0628, 0.4793, 0.0734], ["REAR", 0.3261, 0.08, 0.3564, 0.0906], ["DOOR", 0.3605, 0.0787, 0.3918, 0.0906], ["Adjusting", 0.2634, 0.1124, 0.3099, 0.1257], ["Rear", 0.314, 0.1124, 0.3352, 0.123], ["Door", 0.3392, 0.1124, 0.3625, 0.1243], ["On", 0.3665, 0.1124, 0.3807, 0.1243], ["Hinges:", 0.3847, 0.1138, 0.4196, 0.1257], ["Remove", 0.2634, 0.131, 0.3018, 0.1495], ["door", 0.3059, 0.131, 0.3276, 0.1495], ["trim", 0.3322, 0.1362, 0.3514, 0.1455